① I'm a new developer of Mengmeng. Lu dajishen II is the first game I've made, and it's also the first time I've developed a game on the steam platform (it took me more than a month to get on the shelf successfully, a group of people who are nervous). It's inevitable that there will be some hospitality problems. I'd like to say sorry first here!



② In case of any problems in the game, bugs can be fed back by groups, and online services of sexy group owners can be provided;



③ If the game is updated in the future, it may cause the archive to disappear. I am not familiar with the function of the steam platform;



④ Finally, this is the official Penguin group number of ludajishen II → 561271150 so much, excuse me!





(PS: Thank you very much for the up Master of station B: night God doesn't speak, thanks to the video tutorial of night God's game! )
